!Vyline/packages/protocol/data/
!Vyline/packages/protocol/data/desktop-profile.fallback.json
**/desktop-e2ee-keys.json
**/desktop-e2ee-dump.txt
**/storage-*.json
**/tokens.json
**/chatdb-*.json

